<%= email_greeting(@user) %>,

thank you for your booking. Your ad for <%= @day %> is reserved:

  <%= @ad.title %>
  <%= @ad.body %>
  <%= @ad.url %>

Price: <%= @price %>, <%= @vat %>. Paid by invoice; we will send you the
invoice by email.

We review every ad before it runs and will write to you once it is approved.
Until then you can cancel the booking free of charge:

<%= @url %>system/ads/bookings

<%= render "_signature_en.text" %>

<%= render "_footer.text" %>
